# What the seeds of the environments of TestSimulation of the engine must reach: see stmttest.Reached.
# A line is the least number of the total of a kind over all environments, a tab, and the kind.
# The numbers are written by hand, and a recount does not change them. They start from the
# least numbers of main on 2026-11-21, and for a kind that main did not require from a third of
# its total then. A total below its number fails the test, and so does a kind that no run
# reaches three times. The number of a kind of main is the sum of its least numbers in the three
# environments, of 50 seeds each, where each was a number for each seed.
